								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3551.msg39688#msg39688">Discovery changes view of plant-eating dinos: Nigersaurus</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> November 16, 2007, 05:36:15 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
